## 6. Versioning Rules

### When to Bump Versions

| Change Type | Version Bump | Example |
|-------------|-------------|---------|
| Fix typo, minor wording | PATCH (1.0.0 → 1.0.1) | Fix spelling in act prompt |
| Add section, change structure | MINOR (1.0.0 → 1.1.0) | Add new variable, add example |
| Rewrite prompt, change behavior | MAJOR (1.0.0 → 2.0.0) | Complete tone overhaul |

### Version Sync

When bumping a version:
1. Update the `Version` in the .md metadata line
2. Update the `version` in `registry.yaml`
3. Both MUST match at all times

