## 7. File Naming Convention

```
prompts/
├── system_[name].md          # system category
├── demo_[name].md            # demo category
├── act[N]_[name].md          # act category (numbered)
├── query_[name].md           # query category
├── [descriptive]_prompt.md   # generation category
└── registry.yaml             # central catalog
```

Rules:
- All lowercase with underscores
- Category prefix matches the category (except `generation` which uses descriptive names)
- Act files are numbered to preserve ordering
- Extension is always `.md`

