## 9. Industry Standard: Anthropic XML

This project adopts Anthropic's prompt engineering framework as its single standard. Anthropic is the recognized industry leader in structured prompt design — their XML-tagged approach has become the baseline for production prompt engineering across the AI industry.

**Adopted standard:**
- **Anthropic Prompt Engineering Guide** — https://docs.anthropic.com/en/docs/build-with-claude/prompt-engineering/overview
- **XML Tags Guide** — https://docs.anthropic.com/en/docs/build-with-claude/prompt-engineering/use-xml-tags
- **Anthropic Prompt Library** — https://docs.anthropic.com/en/prompt-library/library
- **Interactive Tutorial** (9 chapters) — https://github.com/anthropics/prompt-eng-interactive-tutorial

**Key techniques adopted from Anthropic:**
1. XML tags for unambiguous section boundaries
2. `{{variable}}` templating for dynamic content
3. Chain-of-thought with `<thinking>` / `<answer>` tags
4. Multishot examples with `<example>` tags
5. Role assignment via `<identity>` / `<role>` tags
6. Data/instruction separation via tag isolation

**Principle: structure eliminates ambiguity, and ambiguity is the enemy of reliable AI output.**
